So I hope it becomes clear what I'm trying to do here with the different examples and the different, let's say, stages of human or areas of human activity that then express the same kind of idea. And Jung, of course, brings us very much into psychology and psychotherapy because he was a therapist. He was a psychologist.

00:34:32.649 --> 00:34:54.063
