Similar when you try to figure something out, like a mystery, like a puzzle, you're also going around in circles trying to bring in the pieces to say like, okay, this all points to something. There's something in the middle that connects everything. So I have to apply my mind consciously and willfully and purposefully to bring this forth, to bring it into the world.

00:36:26.310 --> 00:36:49.966
And suddenly it pops out as an insight from the unconscious in consciousness where we can then observe it and understand it like, oh yeah, now, now I get it. That's the problem. Oh, this is what I've been looking for. And it's so interesting because Jung makes this connection to, oh, that's people running around in a, a fire. This would be the very literal approach.

