00:43:43.460 --> 00:44:01.436
That means We find it in many different spheres of human action and also experience. And the purpose of that is that there's something in the middle and this something has to be brought forth. And this can be expressed in people moving in a circle, for example, when they dance or they're in a circle pit.

00:44:02.863 --> 00:44:22.707
